Core code-completion behavior was extracted and reimplemented from open-source
Kilo Code (kilocode), after the v7 product line became heavier for standalone
inline completion use:

- https://github.com/Kilo-Org/kilocode
- Classic autocomplete reference: https://github.com/Kilo-Org/kilocode-legacy

This repository ships JetBrains and VS Code hosts today. It is not a redistribution of either host, a VS Code extension-host bridge, or a `kilo serve` RPC bridge.

Runtime: JetBrains IntelliJ Platform and VS Code (under their respective platform terms).

No third-party model weights or API keys are bundled.
See docs/SOURCES.md for mapping notes.
